  <item>
    <title>Vol 21. 税期过后，轮到我吐槽加拿大税务局了</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a1f46f17444b572223260fa</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a1f46f17444b572223260fa</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 02 Jun 2026 21:17:36 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>AI写的前言</span></strong><span>：每年报税季结束后，加拿大人都会有一种如释重负的感觉。</span></p><p><span>但作为税务从业者，我们总会忍不住问一个问题：</span></p><p><span>为什么一个现代社会最基本的公民义务，会让这么多人感到焦虑、困惑，甚至心虚？</span></p><p><span>这一期节目，我邀请了一位老朋友做客。我们从不同角度聊聊 CRA 这个让加拿大人又爱又恨的机构。</span></p><p><span>从 Bare Trust 到 UHT，从 Capital Gains Inclusion Rate 的反复变化，到那些早已取消却仍被纳税人惦记的税务抵免；从免费报税的理想，到越来越高的合规成本；从 CRA 的信件恐惧症，到普通人面对税法时的无力感。</span></p><p><span>我们并不是反对交税，也不是教大家如何省税。</span></p><p><span>我们更想讨论的是：</span></p><p><span>当税法越来越复杂、政策变化越来越频繁的时候，CRA 是否默认每个加拿大人都应该持续关注并理解这些规则？</span></p><p><span>如果做不到，责任又该由谁承担？</span></p><p><span>税期结束了。</span></p><p><span>现在，轮到我们吐槽 CRA 了。</span></p><p><strong><span>主播写的附言</span></strong><span>：</span></p><p><span>感冒没好，大概以后也不会好了，私信骂我前鼻音太重的，哎，你开心就好。</span></p><p><strong><span>瞎写的Timeline:</span></strong></p><ol><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="141">02:21</a> 吐槽点1：付费履行公民的义务，合理吗</span></p></li><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="986">16:26</a> 吐槽点2：都2026年了，AI都盛行了，税务局的系统低智能得像10年前的产物懒得写了</span></p></li><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1474">24:34</a> 吐槽点3：税务局朝令夕改，挨骂的都是我们！</span></p></li></ol><p></p><p><strong><span>Music:</span></strong></p><p><span>Sassy Swing — Audio Library Beats Group</span><br><span>天才白痴钱钱钱-许冠杰</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6697286ae90922dfb2366b18/ls3K15_FHsV7QSI-rlru3Ueoc86l.m4a" length="37262319" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:38:24</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqET24EdH1usKUPxyXxO51s9qq3y.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol 20 从殖民公司到百货公司：HBC的前世今生</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/683c00c331215eb506c3df28</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">683c00c331215eb506c3df28</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 01 Jun 2025 07:32:26 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在加拿大几乎家喻户晓的老牌百货公司——Hudson's Bay Company（HBC），在2025年宣布关闭所有门店。一家从1670年就存在的公司，撑过了皮草贸易、英法殖民战争、国家诞生、全球化浪潮，却没能扛过现代零售业的变革。这一集，我想从头讲起，讲讲这个“开启一个国家”的公司，是如何一步步从殖民工具、皮草巨头，变成你我都逛过的百货公司，再到如今落幕的全过程。</span></p><span></span><p><span>有几个口误，懒得改了，报好意思~</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎧 </span><strong><span>节目时间线 / Episode Timeline：</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="109">01:49</a></span></strong><span>｜寻找海狸皮的探险</span></li><span>  </span><li><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrH2iyk0w6eMZnb_tdo_N_vlIHZR.png"></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="312">05:12</a></span></strong><span>｜HBC和皇家宪章</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="497">08:17</a></span></strong><span>｜鲁珀特是哪位？</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="660">11:00</a></span></strong><span>｜海狸皮到底有多好？</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="805">13:25</a></span></strong><span>｜最大的敌人：法国人</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1041">17:21</a></span></strong><span>｜英法之战</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1180">19:40</a></span></strong><span>｜加东：upper Canada vs. lower Canada</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1343">22:23</a></span></strong><span>｜加西：HBC vs 西北公司</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1590">26:30</a></span></strong><span>｜肉干之战</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1755">29:15</a></span></strong><span>｜BC历史中的HBC</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1940">32:20</a></span></strong><span>｜加拿大向HBC买Rupert's Land</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2110">35:10</a></span></strong><span>｜HBC后半生</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2387">39:47</a></span></strong><span>｜HBC与原住民的关系</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2545">42:25</a></span></strong><span>｜尾声：作为一名前HBC员工的情感记忆与时代告别</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h1><br></h1><span></span><h1><span>VINTAGE HUDSON'S BAY COMMERCIALS - THE BAY 1980s:</span></h1><span></span><p><span><a data-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0e2xVXZciNk" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0e2xVXZciNk">www.youtube.com</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>背景乐：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>Rise Again by Alex</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Solace by Scott Buckley</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Fate And Fortune by Scott Buckley</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Escape – Land of Fire&nbsp;</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
