  <item>
    <title>Vol 11. 午夜梦回，想起此事仍会扇自己两巴掌</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66fcd31f81cdab3a936f1e1a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66fcd31f81cdab3a936f1e1a</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 02 Oct 2024 14:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>这期的关键词</span></strong><span>：racism、霸凌与被霸凌、Peer pressure、断崖式分手、家暴、宽恕、青春期</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们人生中做过很多错事，但是总有一两件是让我们耿耿于怀，久久不能宽恕自己的。这一期我 和 Sky 分享了各自在青春期中做过的错事，不期待会在有生之年得到当事人的宽恕，但我想鼓起勇气说出来这些事会是自我释怀的第一步吧。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>时间线：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="40">00:40</a> 我忏悔，我有罪</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="135">02:15</a> &nbsp;对不起，我对一个老师做了种族歧视的事</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="606">10:06</a> &nbsp;Racist 不仅仅是当面令人受到伤害的。</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="814">13:34</a> &nbsp;同伴压力可能导致错误和愚蠢的行为</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1130">18:50</a> &nbsp;对不起，我没有制止霸凌</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1840">30:40</a> 被班主任带头霸凌是什么感觉</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2290">38:10</a> &nbsp;对不起，我为了自保和我的朋友划清界限</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2580">43:00</a> 老师在校园霸凌里扮演了什么角色</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2728">45:28</a> 对不起，我对你断崖式分手 </span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3186">53:06</a> 现实版“小S和黄子佼的世纪大和解”</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3380">56:20</a> 对不起，我利用了清纯大哥的感情</span><br><span></span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Sky的播客</span></strong><span>：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/663e4c6cb813c7172b398bab" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/663e4c6cb813c7172b398bab"><span>不方便杂坛</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>音乐</span></strong><span>： Cosy dreaming by Snoozybeats </span><a href="https://soundcloud.com/snoozybeats" data-url="https://soundcloud.com/snoozybeats"><span>soundcloud.com</span></a><br><span></span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ltr0Rkfg_uiNzekelmNXYtihIzzK.m4a" length="65403954" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:07:24</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoApQ2ZNY97DSA0NH2AgCyYvZhvL.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol 10. 会计准则里的人生哲学</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66ea83103a5ff0a0ca3028ec</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66ea83103a5ff0a0ca3028ec</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 18 Sep 2024 14:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我悟了，我用会计的语言来化解了我的一些困惑和不安，自我感觉还挺有用的。不管是不是读会计的你，都能喜欢</span></p><span></span><p><span>今日内容：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="124">02:04</a> 属于我们的权益≈留存收益</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="287">04:47</a> 祝你每一天都能收支平衡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="543">09:03</a> 父母不是我们的股东</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="990">16:30</a> 有得必有失，得失必相等</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1140">19:00</a> “低配得感”的人容易忽略“无形资产”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1410">23:30</a> “脱不掉的长衫”就是减值的资产</span></p><span></span><p><span>借方人生，贷方哲学，愿下辈子我远离会计吧。</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵 Track Info:</span></p><span></span><p><span>Title: August Rain by Snoozybeats</span></p>]]></description>
