    <title>Vol 7: 辩论：跨性别女运动员参与奥运会女性竞技是否公平</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66cd6f62f78678cbe767bcd6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66cd6f62f78678cbe767bcd6</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 28 Aug 2024 14:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>虽然奥运已经结束，但是“跨性别女性运动员和顺性别女性运动是否应该同台竞技”这个话题依然在继续。至今，还有很多人在非互联网头条的地方，依旧为自己的立场而奋斗。那么，今天我和Sky浅浅辩论一下这个严肃的话题。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们设置了一个投票，大家可以互动一下，看看能否碰撞出一些火花。</span></p><span></span><p><span>注：我们的目的只是为了打开我们的信息茧房。辩论只是一种形式，我们都是相亲相爱的好闺蜜。</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间线：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="32">0:00:32</a> 这个话题从何而来，我们的目的，定义辩题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="403">0:06:43</a> 辩论双方的观点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="716">0:11:56</a> 正方观点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2801">0:46:41</a> 反方观点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3801">1:03:21</a> 开放环节</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5220">1:27:00</a> 最后一起吐槽：这个话题太敏感，太早期，太极端</span></p><span></span><p><span>Citation:</span></p><span></span><p><span>"IOC releases Framework on Fairness, Inclusion and Non-discrimination on the basis of gender identity and sex variations - Olympic News.” Olympics, 16 November 2021, </span><a href="https://olympics.com/ioc/news/ioc-releases-framework-on-fairness-inclusion-and-non-discrimination-on-the-basis-of-gender-identity-and-sex-variations" data-url="https://olympics.com/ioc/news/ioc-releases-framework-on-fairness-inclusion-and-non-discrimination-on-the-basis-of-gender-identity-and-sex-variations"><span>olympics.com</span></a><span>. Accessed 26 August 2024.</span></p><span></span><p><span>Dennis L. Weisman. Transgender Athletes, Fair Competition, and Public Policy. Fall 2022. Regulation. </span><a href="https://www.cato.org/sites/cato.org/files/2022-09/regulation-v45n3-7.pdf" data-url="https://www.cato.org/sites/cato.org/files/2022-09/regulation-v45n3-7.pdf"><span>www.cato.org</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>Oberlin DJ. Sex differences and athletic performance. Where do trans individuals fit into sports and athletics based on current research? Front Sports Act Living. 2023 Oct 27;5: 12 24476. doi: 10.3389/fspor.2023.1224476. PMID: 37964771; PMCID: PMC10641525</span></p><span></span><p><span>Herman JLF, Andrew R, O'Neill KK. How Many Adults and Youth Identify as Transgender in the United States? 2022, Williams Institute, UCLA School of Law.</span></p><span></span><p><span>澎湃新闻, and 游识猷. “奥委会用激素水平决定“能否参加女子组比赛”，这合理吗？.” 06 08 2021, </span><a href="https://finance.sina.cn/2021-08-06/detail-ikqcfncc1273700.d.html?from=wap" data-url="https://finance.sina.cn/2021-08-06/detail-ikqcfncc1273700.d.html?from=wap"><span>finance.sina.cn</span></a><span>.</span></p>]]></description>
